{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kzAdpwjKcn1793630796.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港交所計劃明年3月起，將衍生產品收市後交易時段，延長1小時15分鐘。</p><p></p><p>由原本凌晨3時，延長至凌晨4時15分才收市。港交所表示，新安排讓市場參與者，在香港日間交易時段以外，因應外圍市況靈活管理風險。港交所將視乎之後發展，考慮是否在2027年11月，進一步將收市時間延長至凌晨5時15分。為配合交易時段延長，部分交易後服務及風險管理程序將作相應調整，日間交易及假期安排維持不變。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:05.770454+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:39:14.167835+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:28.788404+00:00","content_hash":"361cada5dafbd36b35f49951b7d984890366ea511c40427d13aa6f9970779a65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:05.770454+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}